<!doctype html>
<html lang="{{ request.locale.iso_code }}">
  <head>
    {% # Inlined CSS Variables %}
    {% render 'css-variables' %}

    {% comment %}
      Font preloading:
      1. Preconnect to font CDN for faster connection
      2. Preload only the critical font variant (base weight)
      3. Additional variants load on-demand via @font-face
    {% endcomment %}
    {% unless settings.type_primary_font.system? and settings.type_heading_font.system? %}
      <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.shopifycdn.com" crossorigin>
    {% endunless %}

    {% unless settings.type_primary_font.system? %}
      {% comment %} Preload only the body font base variant (ADR 0003: preload 1 font) {% endcomment %}
      {{ settings.type_primary_font | font_url | preload_tag: as: 'font', crossorigin: 'anonymous' }}
    {% endunless %}

    {%- if settings.favicon != blank -%}
      <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="{{ settings.favicon | image_url: width: 32, height: 32 }}">
    {%- endif -%}

    {% # Load and preload the critical CSS %}
    {{ 'critical.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag: preload: true }}
    {{ 'base.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

    {% # Social, title, etc. %}
    {% render 'meta-tags' %}

    {{ content_for_header }}
    <script src="{{ 'standard-events.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
    <script src="{{ 'motion.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
    <script src="{{ 'page-layers.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
  </head>

  <body>
    {% comment %}
      Đếm lớp đang mở, banner consent, nút Shopify Inbox (ADR 0007 mục 6). Thẻ script và
      assets/page-layers.js do BE (TE-10-R2-BE1); element gắn html[data-layer-open],
      html[data-consent] + --consent-height, html[data-inbox], phát layers:idle.
      data-inbox-selector: KHÔNG CHẮC, BE xác nhận trên store dev; giữ trùng selector trong assets/base.css.
    {% endcomment %}
    <page-layers data-testid="page-layers" data-inbox-selector="#ShopifyChat, #dummy-chat-button-iframe"></page-layers>

    <div class="header-sticky-sentinel" data-testid="header-sticky-sentinel" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    {% block 'container', tag: 'div' %}
      {% block 'announcement-bar' -%}{%- endblock %}
    {% endblock %}

    {% block 'container', tag: 'div' %}
      {% block 'header' -%}{%- endblock %}
    {% endblock %}

    <main>
      {{ content_for_layout }}
    </main>

    {% block 'container', tag: 'div' %}
      {% block 'footer', newsletter_image: images['efx-news.jpg'] -%}{%- endblock %}
    {% endblock %}

    {% # No container: the dialog sits outside the page flow, it is not a band. %}
    {% block 'cart-drawer' -%}{%- endblock %}

    {% comment %}
      Toast chung (layers.md §2.4): chỉ dùng khi không có lớp modal mở; phản hồi trong lớp modal
      nằm ở role="status"/role="alert" của chính lớp. JS chèn toast vào đây; toast cảnh báo, lỗi
      mang role="alert" riêng. Kiểu toast: TE-10-R2-FE2.
      Hợp đồng cho BE (foundation §17, TE-10 AC11): clone template[data-testid="toast-template"]
      > [data-toast="info|success|warning|error"], điền [data-toast-title], [data-toast-text]
      (bỏ hidden khi có mô tả), chép tiêu đề vào [data-toast-dismiss-title] để nút đóng có tên
      "Dismiss: {tiêu đề}"; nút [data-toast-dismiss] gỡ toast. info, success tự ẩn 6 s (dừng khi
      hover/focus); warning, error không tự ẩn; tối đa 3 toast. Gắn data-closing trước khi gỡ để
      CSS mờ dần.
    {% endcomment %}
    <div class="toast-region" data-testid="toast-region" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <template data-testid="toast-template">
      {%- assign toast_types = 'info,success,warning,error' | split: ',' -%}
      {%- for toast_type in toast_types -%}
        <div
          class="toast toast--{{ toast_type }}"
          role="{% if toast_type == 'warning' or toast_type == 'error' %}alert{% else %}status{% endif %}"
          data-toast="{{ toast_type }}"
          data-testid="toast-{{ toast_type }}"
        >
          <span class="toast__icon">{% render 'status-icon', name: toast_type %}</span>
          <div class="toast__body">
            <p class="toast__title" data-toast-title></p>
            <p class="toast__text" data-toast-text hidden></p>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="close-button toast__close" data-toast-dismiss data-testid="toast-dismiss">
            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'general.dismiss' | t }} <span data-toast-dismiss-title></span></span>
            {%- render 'header-icon', name: 'close' -%}
          </button>
        </div>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </template>
  </body>
</html>
